	["lever"] = {
		assists = { "High capacity with unwasteful reloads.", "Strong in its intended range, but lacks the fire-power of full rifles.", "[@ALT] to Hip Brace, considerably improving mobility and stability at a cost of precision." },
		size = 2,
		name = "\'Crestfall\' Lever Rifle",
		desc = "Lethal and fast firing rifle, excelling at close to mid range duels.",
		lore = "The Nation\'s dogma was clear: Females were not to be given the rites of royalty, for it would represent bending a knee to the Queen\'s propaganda. And yet, the King\'s tongue slipped. \'My daughter will be given her seat at the table, one way or another,\' he so brazenly declared.\n\nThe gazes of a dozen Kings burrowed deep into the man, a mixture of pity, shock, and scorn. It wasn\'t long before he was brought before the people of Avvalia \226\128\147 his people \226\128\147 to stand trial for treason.\n\nHe pleaded, begged, and wept in a beggar\'s rags, his regalia stripped from his body and his own rifle pointed at his head. And yet, the people looked on without sympathy or remorse as the Old Guard brought judgement upon him.",
