		size = 1,
		name = "Army Machete",
		desc = "Your trusted machete for massacre, the best you have at all times.",
		lore = "The machetes history is often mixed, on one hand of history, it is an agricultural tool used for splitting often hard objects in a rainforest such as coconuts or sugar canes.\n\nOn the other hand, it is a brutal tool of combat, uprising against a regime often wielded by civilians or a favoured intimidation tool of Bandits all around.\n\nRegardless of its history\226\128\148its yours now.\nPerhaps it will find a home deep in the rib-cage of someone who never deserved it or in your own hands.\n\nThe machete is the one tool the Solace Coalition refuses to manufacture, as it symbolises brutality against not just fellow soldiers, but many innocent Solace workers who got off at the wrong place, at the wrong time.",
